{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>And also from the children of the toshavim.</b> Who dwell in the land of Canaan, which is your land, and they are from the nations mentioned, or Egyptians, and any nation outside the seven nations — for Scripture warned concerning them, \"You shall not let any soul live\" — so it is forbidden even to keep them [as slaves]. And perhaps the Sages, of blessed memory, said \"Canaanite slave\" concerning a ger who sojourns in the land of Canaan but is not a Canaanite by lineage. Or they knew how to bring this matter to its truth, for our mind is slight compared to their mind."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:31.616506174Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}